# Relay broker ACL (ADR-0033). Two identities, least privilege:
#   relayd  — the relay daemon on .210: full access to relay/# (it answers requests)
#   ha2     — the air-gap client (ha-2): may ASK (publish requests) and READ replies, nothing else.
# Anything outside relay/# is denied to everyone (no default topic access without a user stanza).

user relayd
topic readwrite relay/#

user ha2
topic write relay/+/request
topic read relay/+/response
topic write relay/alert/out
